OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to expand city centre
OL,4,Abusking zones drawn up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of designated zones for
OL,7,Fbuskers in Leicester city centre could
OL,8,Fbe expanded under new proposals.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council set out four
OL,11,Fpitches for performers earlier this
OL,12,Fyear when it launched a pilot scheme,
OL,13,Fcalled Busk Leicester, in a bid to both
OL,14,Fencourage and manage street
OL,15,Fentertainers.
OL,17,FOfficials have published a report after
OL,18,Fassessing the scheme, which shows there
OL,19,Fhave been 117 free-of-charge bookings
OL,20,Fat the pitch sites since the project
OL,21,Fbegan.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
